*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Canon Zoemini 2 / Ivy 2 / iNSPiC PV-223 over Bluetooth,
*% for the zoemini CUPS filter and backend.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.4.6"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "ZOEMINI2.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Canon"
*Product: "(Zoemini 2)"
*ModelName: "Canon Zoemini 2"
*ShortNickName: "Canon Zoemini 2"
*NickName: "Canon Zoemini 2, zoemini 0.4.6"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Canon;MDL:Zoemini 2;CMD:JPEG;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/vnd.zoemini-jpeg 10 zoemini"
*cupsFilter2: "image/jpeg application/vnd.zoemini-jpeg 10 zoemini"
*cupsFilter2: "image/png application/vnd.zoemini-jpeg 10 zoemini"
*cupsFilter2: "image/tiff application/vnd.zoemini-jpeg 10 zoemini"
*cupsFilter2: "image/gif application/vnd.zoemini-jpeg 10 zoemini"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: 2x3.Fullbleed
*PageSize 2x3.Fullbleed/2 x 3 in (ZINK): "<</PageSize[144 216]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: 2x3.Fullbleed
*PageRegion 2x3.Fullbleed/2 x 3 in (ZINK): "<</PageSize[144 216]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: 2x3.Fullbleed
*ImageableArea 2x3.Fullbleed/2 x 3 in (ZINK): "0 0 144 216"
*DefaultPaperDimension: 2x3.Fullbleed
*PaperDimension 2x3.Fullbleed/2 x 3 in (ZINK): "144 216"

*OpenUI *ZoeminiScaling/Scaling: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ZoeminiScaling
*DefaultZoeminiScaling: Fill
*ZoeminiScaling Fill/Fill the print (crop): ""
*ZoeminiScaling Fit/Whole image (white bands): ""
*CloseUI: *ZoeminiScaling

*OpenUI *ZoeminiEnhance/Image enhancement: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ZoeminiEnhance
*DefaultZoeminiEnhance: On
*ZoeminiEnhance On/On (tone curve and sharpening): ""
*ZoeminiEnhance Off/Off (raw): ""
*CloseUI: *ZoeminiEnhance

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*% End of zoemini2.ppd
